swimlane Library release
// From: release.sh:53,72-75,93,104-109,132,141-148; .github/workflows/release.yml:98,109-122,142,153,158
direction-lr
lane Maintainer gray
  (Start) -> Run release.sh
  Run release.sh -> Build and check
lane Release script blue
  Build and check -> <On npm already?>
  <On npm already?>
    -yes-> (Already published) success
    -no-> Tag and push
  Tag and push -> Dispatch release workflow
  Dispatch release workflow -> Verify tag matches package.json
  Check npm serves version -> (Released) success
lane GitHub Actions green
  Verify tag matches package.json -> Typecheck lint test build
  Typecheck lint test build -> Publish library
  Publish library -> Publish standalone
  Publish standalone -> Create GitHub release
  Create GitHub release -> Check npm serves version
